  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Climate change'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Climate change poses both a physical and a transition risk to HCLTech’s business operations. Physical risks include extreme weather events like droughts, floods, cyclones, wildfires and heat stress. Transition risks include changes in policy and regulatory context leading to increased carbon prices, taxes and cost of doing business. It also includes business continuity risks. The opportunity to be climate resilient and climate positive includes developing climate resilient processes, operations, value chain, products, services and solutions that not only support our journey but also that of our clients and partners.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'As a part of our net- zero strategy, HCLTech is committed to limiting greenhouse gas emissions aligned to the 1.5ºC pathway by 2030 and to achieving net zero by 2040. A clear roadmap is planned towards this commitment. We are making steady progress on this roadmap. HCLTech is also developing products, services and solutions that help clients and partners meet their commitments on climate change. HCLTech has continued its journey to identify and execute projects to work with communities to move towards a climate resilient future.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Eco – efficiency'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Eco-efficiency is an opportunity for HCLTech to improve its operational efficiency on its ecological performance related to energy, waste, water and other resources.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCLTech has implemented various energy efficiency initiatives to reduce energy consumption, water consumption and waste minimization. HCLTech has defined monitoring and governance systems covering all eco-efficiency parameters. These are reviewed at regular intervals and budgets are allocated for performance improvement.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Human capital'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'HCLTech defines human capital as skills, knowledge and experience possessed by an employee or a team, that can be valuable to the organization. We require constant upskilling and reskilling of our employees to ensure we deliver top services to our clients in a rapidly evolving digital technology space. Human capital is an important risk as well as opportunity for us.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCLTech has a clear institutional mechanism to map future skillset requirements and has programs for upskilling and reskilling employees. There are measurements used to gauge the performance of the initiative, which are reviewed periodically.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Local hiring'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Hiring local talent in places where we do business is an important risk and opportunity for us.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Hiring locally is not just the right thing to do, but an effective strategy to improve talent retention. It also conveys our commitment to the community that we are invested in that location. Across the globe, in the countries where we operate, we are investing in local talent. As a strategy HCLTech has expanded its offices to smaller cities (New Vistas) and provided a hybrid workspace to further enable people prospects.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Diversity and inclusion (D&I)'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'To maintain our innovative culture, we recognize the importance of diversity in thought, ideas and perspectives. There is ample evidence to highlight that having diverse perspectives in a team creates better work outcomes in addition to better team coherence and has a positive impact on creativity, problem-solving and overall organizational success.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCLTech has clear policies, processes and governance structures to monitor the performance of our D&I strategy. We have an ESG and DEI Committee set up in\nour Board to ensure a strategic focus. Goals and targets are identified and integrated into the performance evaluation of leaders. A separate team works on various\ninitiatives to further our commitment.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Talent attraction and retention'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Meeting the increasing demand for new talent poses a significant risk and a unique opportunity. The increasing shifts globally towards the adoption of digital solutions and increasing range and diversity of technology solutions have put the focus on striving the right balance between demand and supply of appropriate skillsets. We\nview it as an opportunity to align our work culture\nwith global trends, thereby enhancing employee retention while also increasing their efficiency.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCLTech’s strategy is to focus on building the workplace of tomorrow—one which promotes equality of opportunity, a collaborative and transparent culture and deploys a robust training strategy designed to meet the development needs of employees at all levels. The company provides employees with progressive career paths through internal opportunities.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Work environment'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'HCLTech identifies work environment as a material topic considering both the emotional and physical aspects of our employees.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Good workspaces, wellness spaces, creches, gyms, etc., are integral parts of our offices. It is also important to create an environment that is safe where employees have the confidence and trust to report on any kind of discrimination or harassment.\nWe ensure that our offices are designed and planned to ensure the comfort of our employees.\nWe have clear policies and processes to prevent any discrimination and harassment in our workplaces. These are communicated regularly and employees are encouraged to report on any incidents.\nWe have tracking mechanisms to ensure we take preventive steps. Independent investigation of incidents is also ensured.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Citizenship'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Corporate citizenship is\nnot just an opportunity\nfor HCLTech but rather\nit is the backbone of\nthe organization. It is\nour responsibility to the\ncommunity in which\nwe operate.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCL Foundation in\nIndia and the various\nemployee councils\naround the world\nhighlight our focus. Apart from the positive impact on the community members/program participants, our\ninitiatives demonstrate\nour commitment to the communities in which we operate.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Sustainable\nimpact on\nclients'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'As technology solutions are deployed at greater scale and complexity to solve major problems around the world, their sustainable and responsible use becomes critical to limit their footprint and to avoid unintended consequences.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'As a leader in IT services, HCLTech is uniquely positioned to assist its clients to innovate through advanced technology and digitalization while being responsible in its usage.\nHCLTech already works with clients on several sustainable solutions. Therefore, we created a dedicated team which works with various sector heads to identify opportunities related to sustainability and create appropriate sustainability-related solutions for our clients.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Cyber\nsecurity, data\nprotection\nand system\navailability'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Greater adoption of technology globally has led to increased incidents of cyberattacks and frauds. This has led to a greater focus on the need to build robust, secure and sophisticated solutions that are secure, safe and robust. Data privacy and security are critical features.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCLTech ensures a globally interconnected oversight framework involving governance, policies, procedures, training and awareness programs, global privacy\nimpact assessments, privacy by design, data mapping, third-party contractual oversight, incident management and a mechanism for monitoring regulatory compliance for every geography. Our Crisis & Resilience program highlights our focus on integrating resilience as an intrinsic part of our business operating model and seeks to embed “resilience by design” across the dimensions of work, personnel, workplace, business operations, technology, supply chain and leadership.\nOur Information and cybersecurity program ensures a strong security posture for HCLTech and our clients. Our security posture has been validated by independent, industry recognized certifications and attestation standards, including quarterly oversight by the Board. We also have cyber insurance that covers different types of breaches and cyber events.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Sustainable\nProcurement'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'For sustainability to be effective at derisking the organization, it needs to be deployed beyond our internal operations to cover our supply chain. A supply chain that is at odds with our sustainability goals and priorities is a risk to our achievement of our goals.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Through responsible sourcing, collaboration with upstream and downstream partners and improving supply chain governance, HCLTech has integrated sustainability into its procurement process.\nBoth the Supplier Code of Conduct and Procurement Policy has integrated sustainability requirements. ESG has been incorporated as a risk domain in the Vendor onboarding process for new vendors.\nHCLTech has also conducted risk evaluation of the supply chain based on ESG guidelines and identified categories\nand vendors who will be audited. The audit requirements\nare integrated into the Vendor Risk Management program (R&C).'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Governance\nand ethics'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The regulations around governance are significant and increasingly becoming more stringent around requirements on accountability, transparency and\nfairness.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'HCLTech has stipulated policies, processes and systems to ensure ethical conduct and strong governance. Governance and Ethics are the foundations of the HCLTech culture. We structure our governance to permeate ethical conduct throughout the organization. Our strong governance and ethical culture ensure our viability over the long term.\nThe Code of Business Ethics and Conduct (COBEC) is our principal document that outlines the way HCLTech employees should conduct business.\nThe whistle-blower policy and various other reporting channels help to identify any challenges that need to be corrected. The Board reviews this periodically through the Audit Committee.\nWe are focused on both current and future regulations to ensure we are fully prepared for any change.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
