  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'HasTheEntityCarriedOutIndependentAssessmentEvaluationOfTheWorkingOfItsPoliciesByAnExternalAgency' (HasTheEntityCarriedOutIndependentAssessmentEvaluationOfTheWorkingOfItsPoliciesByAnExternalAgency) is 'true'.",
