    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NameOfTheAgencyIfTheEntityCarriedOutIndependentAssessmentEvaluationOfTheWorkingOfItsPoliciesByAnExternalAgencyExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: D_Principle2)"
  },
