  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard' (DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The Company receives from the members of the Board, a list of entities in which they are interested, at the beginning of every financial year and as and when there is any change in such interest. It is ensured that the requisite approvals as required under the statute as well as the Company's policies are in place before transacting with such entities. Further, the Company has adopted the Code of Business Ethics and Conduct which requires that the Directors of the Company avoid any activity or association that creates or appears to create a conflict between the personal interests of the Directors and the business interests of the Company.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesPrinciple1ExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesPrinciple1ExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Essential Indicator 1\nNote:\n- The entire personnel of HCLTech are categorized as “Employees” and not as “Workers”. Therefore, the information required in all sections in the “workers” category is not applicable to HCLTech.\n- Inorganic headcount was not considered in the reporting boundary for the above disclosure for “Employees other than BoD and KMPs”\n- The above training is mandatory for all employees upon joining and must be completed on an annual basis. As the data is specific to the financial year 2024-25, the percentages provided do not account for employees whose training completion is due after March 31, 2025.\n\n\nEssential Indicator 5\nNote: The entire personnel of HCLTech are categorized as “Employees” and not as “Workers”. Therefore, the information required in all sections in the “workers” category is not applicable to HCLTech.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NotesPrinciple1ExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'TotalNumberOfAwarenessProgrammesHeld' (TotalNumberOfAwarenessProgrammesHeld) is '1454' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: TotalNumberOfAwarenessProgrammesHeld, Context: D_AwarenessProgrammesConductedForValueChainPartners1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'TopicsOrPrinciplesCoveredUnderTheTraining' (TopicsOrPrinciplesCoveredUnderTheTraining) is 'The following topics were addressed in various programs:\n•\tRisk assessment & work permit system awareness,\n•\tAwareness on electrical safety,\n•\tLOTO (Lockout-Tagout) system,\n•\tEnergy consumption & conservation,\n•\tChemical safety & MSDS awareness,\n•\tFire safety, emergency preparedness & evacuation procedure awareness,\n•\tAwareness on incident reporting & management,\n•\tAwareness on QHSEE Policy- objectives & targets,\n•\tAwareness on Legal compliances,\n•\tAwareness on power tools safety, PPE & its Importance,\n•\tWaste management, working at height, slip-trip- fall & ergonomics awareness\n•\tConfined space & lone working awareness, safe driving / road safety,\n•\tEnergy conservation, environmental impacts\n•\tESG manual that outlines its sustainability objectives and guidelines.\n•\tInternal auditor training on ISO 9001, ISO14001 and ISO 45001\n•\tInternal auditor training on ISO 50001\n•\tGRI awareness training\n•\tWaste segregation and disposal training\n•\tIncident management training\n•\tNear miss reporting\n•\tAwareness on safe work at height and in confined spaces\n•\tHSE monitoring and measurement training'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: TopicsOrPrinciplesCoveredUnderTheTraining, Context: D_AwarenessProgrammesConductedForValueChainPartners1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfValueChainPartnersCoveredUnderTheAwarenessProgrammes' (PercentageOfValueChainPartnersCoveredUnderTheAwarenessProgrammes) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfValueChainPartnersCoveredUnderTheAwarenessProgrammes, Context: D_AwarenessProgrammesConductedForValueChainPartners1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfRAndD' (PercentageOfRAndD) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfRAndD, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfRAndD' (PercentageOfRAndD) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfRAndD, Context: DPYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD' (DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD) is 'Investments in research and development (R&D) are made to enhance the effectiveness of our existing products and services, as well as to create new ones. Upgrading legacy code improves performance efficiency and leads to environmental benefits. Moreover, we focus on enhancing our products to provide better security and privacy for our users.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfCapex' (PercentageOfCapex) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfCapex, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfCapex' (PercentageOfCapex) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfCapex, Context: DPYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex' (DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex) is 'Our capital expenditure primarily focuses on infrastructure, enhancing our energy efficiency and accessibility through improved equipment and buildings.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
