    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForPlasticsIncludingPackagingExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForPlasticsIncludingPackagingExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Not Applicable to HCLTech as the Company does not engage in any product manufacturing activities.'.",
