    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfValueChainPartnersP3' (PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfValueChainPartnersP3) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
