  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfOtherChannelsOfCommunication' (DetailsOfOtherChannelsOfCommunication) is '• Online surveys\n• Focus group\ndiscussions\n• One-on-one\ninterviews\n• Non-deal roadshows\n• Investor events\n(one-on-one and in\ngroups) and reverse\nroadshows.\n• Geo-based\nmanagement-level\nmeetings post\nquarterly results.\n• Webinars (one-onone\nand in groups).'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfOtherChannelsOfCommunication, Context: D_StakeHolderGroups1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FrequencyOfEngagement' (FrequencyOfEngagement) is 'Quarterly'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FrequencyOfEngagement, Context: D_StakeHolderGroups1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PurposeAndScopeOfEngagementIncludingKeyTopicsAndConcernsRaisedDuringSuchEngagement' (PurposeAndScopeOfEngagementIncludingKeyTopicsAndConcernsRaisedDuringSuchEngagement) is 'Purpose:\nTo maximize shareholder value, attract investment, and provide transparent information.\n\nScope:\nRegular financial reporting, investor conferences, analyst interactions, and timely updates on business performance, strategy, and corporate governance.\n\nAspects discussed:\nEmerging business risks and opportunities related to sustainability/ESG issues affecting reputation and business performance, 3-to-5-year ESG Roadmap, delivery model, hybrid work environment, supply-side pressures like attrition rate and hiring rate, and sustainability of demand.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PurposeAndScopeOfEngagementIncludingKeyTopicsAndConcernsRaisedDuringSuchEngagement, Context: D_StakeHolderGroups1)"
  },
