  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfOtherChannelsOfCommunication' (DetailsOfOtherChannelsOfCommunication) is '• Online Modes of Communication: Emailers, Newsletters\n• Focus Group Discussions\n• Wellness sessions and Family sessions\n• Surveys: Pulse surveys\n• Employee Passion clubs, Festivals and other celebrations\n• Employee Resource Groups like Women connect, MERG, WAND  ERG, Pride\n• Employee connect portal 360-feedback\n• Client and HCLTech leader sessions'.",
