  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfOtherFrequencyOfEngagement' (DetailsOfOtherFrequencyOfEngagement) is 'Quarterly (depending on engagement):\n\nInternal surveys for supplier performance assessment - Quarterly\n\nOnboarding Assessment during onboarding the new vendor\n\nMonitoring of Supplier escalation mailbox and Vendor Helpdesk as & when raised by suppliers'.",
