  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'No significant risks/concerns were identified'.",
