  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'No significant changes in process were required resulting from the grievances and complaints this year.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'HCLTech has integrated human rights considerations into its operations as well as the new vendor onboarding assessment process, tailoring it to the types of services provided to the Company. HCLTech’s Procurement Policy and Supplier Code of Conduct lay out the Company’s expectations surrounding ethical behavior, labor practices, environmental responsibility, and governance standards. Additionally, HCLTech has a Whistleblower Policy in place that details how to file a complaint, and this information is accessible to all stakeholders. In case of any concerns, vendors can reach out via email at whistleblower@hcltech.com for resolution. Also, HCLTech follows Periodic Assessment as part of the vendor risk management program (R&C).'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IsThePremiseOrOfficeOfTheEntityAccessibleToDifferentlyAbledVisitorsAsPerTheRequirementsOfTheRightsOfPersonsWithDisabilitiesAct2016' (IsThePremiseOrOfficeOfTheEntityAccessibleToDifferentlyAbledVisitorsAsPerTheRequirementsOfTheRightsOfPersonsWithDisabilitiesAct2016) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IsThePremiseOrOfficeOfTheEntityAccessibleToDifferentlyAbledVisitorsAsPerTheRequirementsOfTheRightsOfPersonsWithDisabilitiesAct2016, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
