  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherAnyIndicateIfAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForGreenHouseGasEmissions' (WhetherAnyIndicateIfAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForGreenHouseGasEmissions) is 'true'.",
