  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Not Applicable'.",
