    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesPrinciple8ExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesPrinciple8ExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Notes:\n\nEssential Indicator 5: Job creation is smaller towns\nPlaces categorized as per RBI Classification System for rural/semi-urban/urban/metropolitan\n\nLeadership Indicator 3c\nGlobally, our diverse spending is 21% of the total procurement spend. For combined US, Canada & UK, the spend is 31% of total procurement spend of these geographies.'.",
